{"lang":"tl","dir":"ltr","title":"La Piñata Taqueria | Taco Truck at Burrito sa Vallejo, CA","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Lumaktaw sa nilalaman</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">LP</span><span>La Piñata Taqueria</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">Tungkol sa amin</a><a href=\"menu/\">Menu</a><a href=\"#faq\">FAQ</a><a href=\"#gallery\">Mga larawan</a><a href=\"#reviews\">Mga review</a><a href=\"#visit\">Oras at lokasyon</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"Wika\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\" selected>Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\">中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\">Umorder</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/hero-tacos.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Taco truck · 809 Broadway · Vallejo</p>\n    <h1>La Piñata Taqueria</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">Ang dilaw na taco truck sa Broadway na napasama sa listahan ng San Francisco Chronicle ng pinakamasasarap na burrito sa Bay Area. Malutong na suadero, dalawang masarap na salsa, at malalaking super burrito.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Pi%C3%B1ata+Taqueria/@38.1147339,-122.2487791,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085739c1a6761fb:0x55c92816b09cb66b!8m2!3d38.1147339!4d-122.2487791!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.7 · 276 review sa Google<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> Tumawag para umorder nang maaga</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%2C%20809%20Broadway%2C%20Vallejo%2C%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> Direksyon</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li>#6 sa Top 100 Food Trucks ng Yelp sa US (2025)</li><li>Kasama sa Top Burritos list ng SF Chronicle</li><li>Takeout, order sa telepono at catering</li><li>Mga picnic table sa labas</li><li>Bukas Lunes–Biyernes 11–9</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">Ang truck</p><h2>Sariwang sangkap. Malasang pagkain. Patas na presyo.</h2><p>Ang La Piñata ay isang dilaw na lonchera na nakaparada sa 809 Broadway. Naghahain kami ng tunay na pagkaing Mexicano na gawa sa sariwa at de-kalidad na sangkap: taco, torta, quesadilla, nachos, super burrito at mga putaheng hipon, pati horchata at agua de jamaica.</p><p>Noong 2025, inilagay kami ng Yelp sa #6 ng all-time na listahan nito ng Top 100 Food Trucks sa US, at isinama kami ng San Francisco Chronicle sa listahan nito ng Top Burritos sa Bay Area noong Nobyembre 2022. May mga customer kaming nagmamaneho pa mula San Francisco para dito.</p><div class=\"facts\"><div class=\"fact\"><b>#6</b><span>Yelp Top 100 Food Trucks</span></div><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Pi%C3%B1ata+Taqueria/@38.1147339,-122.2487791,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085739c1a6761fb:0x55c92816b09cb66b!8m2!3d38.1147339!4d-122.2487791!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.7★</b><span>276 review</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>Lun–Biy</b><span>11 AM–9 PM</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/tacos.jpg\" alt=\"Plato ng street tacos ng La Piñata\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"menu\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Menu</p><h2>Ano ang nasa menu</h2><p>Taco, super burrito, torta, nachos at quesadilla.</p></div><div class=\"menu-cards\"><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-tacos\"><img src=\"images/tacos-plate.jpg\" alt=\"Plato ng taco ng La Piñata na may cilantro, sibuyas, labanos at karot\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h3>Tacos</h3><ul><li><span>Taco</span><b>$3.50</b></li></ul></div></a><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-burritos\"><img src=\"images/burrito-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Super burrito ng La Piñata na hinati sa ibabaw ng foil\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h3>Burritos</h3><ul><li><span>Super Burrito</span><b>$16</b></li><li><span>Super Veggie Burrito</span><b>$14</b></li><li><span>Super Shrimp Burrito (hipon)</span><b>$18</b></li></ul><span class=\"more\">+1 pa</span></div></a><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-tortas-nachos-quesadillas\"><img src=\"images/chips-salsas-pickled-veggies.jpg\" alt=\"Chips, pula at berdeng salsa, atsarang karot at inihaw na jalapeño mula sa La Piñata\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h3>Torta, Nachos at Quesadilla</h3><ul><li><span>Torta</span><b>$16</b></li><li><span>Super Nachos</span><b>$16</b></li><li><span>Super Quesadilla</span><b>$16</b></li></ul></div></a><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-drinks\"><div><h3>Inumin</h3><ul><li><span>Soda sa lata</span><b>$2</b></li><li><span>Mexican soda</span><b>$3</b></li><li><span>Tubig</span><b>$1</b></li></ul><span class=\"more\">+1 pa</span></div></a><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-extras\"><div><h3>Mga extra</h3><ul><li><span>Keso, sour cream o abokado sa taco</span><b>$0.25</b></li><li><span>Keso, sour cream o abokado sa burrito</span><b>$1</b></li></ul></div></a></div><div class=\"cta-row menu-cta\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"menu/\">Tingnan ang buong menu at presyo →</a></div><div class=\"menu-source\"><p>Maaaring magbago ang mga presyo.</p></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Mabuting malaman</p><h2>Bago ka pumunta</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>Takeout</b><span>Maayos na nakabalot ang pagkain para i-uwi</span></li><li><b>Order sa telepono</b><span>Tumawag nang maaga para hindi na pumila</span></li><li><b>Catering</b><span>Tawagan ang truck para magtanong</span></li><li><b>Cash o card</b><span>Maaaring may maliit na bayad kapag card ang gamit</span></li><li><b>Paradahan sa kalye</b></li><li><b>Upuan sa labas</b><span>Mga picnic table</span></li><li><b>Pinakamaraming tao tuwing Biyernes bandang 6 PM</b><span>Maaaring umabot nang mga 15 minuto ang paghihintay</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Gallery</p><h2>Diretso mula sa truck</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/tacos-plate.jpg\" alt=\"Plato ng taco na may cilantro, sibuyas, labanos, karot at kalamansi\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Tacos</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/burrito-plate.jpg\" alt=\"Super burrito sa plato na may atsarang karot at isang baso ng horchata\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Super burrito</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/chips-salsas-pickled-veggies.jpg\" alt=\"Chips, pula at berdeng salsa, atsarang karot at inihaw na jalapeño\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Chips, salsa at atsarang gulay</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/burrito-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Burrito na hinati sa ibabaw ng foil\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Burrito</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/burrito-closeup.jpg\" alt=\"Close-up ng burrito na puno ng karne, kanin at keso\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Burrito</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/burrito-foil.jpg\" alt=\"Burritong nakabalot sa foil, nakagatan na\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Burrito na pang-takeout</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"press\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Sa balita</p><h2>Mga parangal</h2></div><div class=\"press\"><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“Our latest obsession is this taco truck. Service is always awesome, employees are always pleasant, and service is fast. Today they packed our food [chicken tacos and super carne asada burritos] with everything extra: plenty of red and green salsa, chips and extra grilled onion/jalapeno. Everything was delicious.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Yelp Top 100 Food Trucks in the US 2025 (#6)</b> · Yelp Elite Carla G. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/article/top-100-food-trucks-2025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“A Suadero Super Burrito from La Piñata might be one of the best things to eat in Vallejo — it’s in the top five at least.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>San Francisco Chronicle</b> · Top Burritos in the Bay Area, Nov 2022</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Mga review</p><h2>Sulit ang biyahe</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.7</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 276 review</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Pi%C3%B1ata+Taqueria/@38.1147339,-122.2487791,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085739c1a6761fb:0x55c92816b09cb66b!8m2!3d38.1147339!4d-122.2487791!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Magbasa pa ng mga review sa Google →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.8</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 438 review</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Magbasa pa ng mga review sa Yelp →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“suadero super burrito 10/10 would recommend. best burrito i’ve had in a minute! my sister got a al pastor taco which was a also very good. solid salsa (red one is sooo good) and food comes with pickles veggies which i love. also jamaica and horchata are both great. the horchata has a little coconut flavor. we live in the city and this beats out the options there. i’d consider driving up for this food tysm &lt;3”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jan 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“La Piñata has been my favorite taco truck in Vallejo for years. Even after moving away, I still compare every taco spot to this one.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Henry D. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · May 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“This is by far the best burrito place in Vallejo hands down. In every bite of my steak and shrimp burrito you can taste the freshness of all the ingredients. He always gives me a free drink when I come. I can appreciate that level of consistent exceptional customer service. Highly Recommended La Piñata !!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“I came here after hearing such great things about La Pinata&#39;s suadero burritos, and they did not disappoint at all! This is a food truck with incredibly kind, hardworking staff…”</blockquote><figcaption>— Lynn N. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“La Piñata is so good. I come from San Francisco for it and always get it when I’m in the area. The owner and staff have amazing customer service and the food is always good and fresh. I don’t usually leave reviews but it’s worth it. My go to is the chicken and shrimp burrito and the steak and shrimp nachos. Chefs kiss!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Monster sized burritos, satisfying eats, actual REAL avocado slices instead of weird guacamole, lots and lots of outdoor seating, plus, ...wait for it.....access to an INDOOR restroom…”</blockquote><figcaption>— Echosaisis A. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · May 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Easily the best Taqueria in Vallejo NGL 🔥 2 Super Steak Burritos w/everything 2 Tacos-1 asada, 1 carnitas Didn&#39;t have to ask for extra sauce , customer service was A+ . 50 min drive was 100% worth it, will def be back”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I got their lengua, cabeza and carnitas tacos. The most was so tender and flavorful. I don&#39;t feel like many do their lengua well, but theirs are definitely one of my favorites. Their salsas are both really good and have a lot of flavor.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I really like to this place. I mean it&#39;s just a taco trailer but the food was good and hardy. The service was quick. And the guy running the thing was pretty nice.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jan 2026</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">FAQ</p><h2>Mga tanong, sinagot</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>Puwede ba akong tumawag para umorder nang maaga?</summary><p>Oo! Tawagan kami sa (707) 334-8381 para umorder nang maaga at hindi na pumila.</p></details><details><summary>Anong oras kayo bukas?</summary><p>Bukas kami Lunes hanggang Biyernes, 11 AM hanggang 9 PM. Sarado tuwing Sabado at Linggo.</p></details><details><summary>Tumatanggap ba kayo ng card?</summary><p>Oo, tumatanggap kami ng cash at card. Maaaring may maliit na bayad kapag card ang gamit.</p></details><details><summary>Ano ang dapat kong orderin?</summary><p>Subukan ang suadero super burrito, ang burrito na itinampok ng San Francisco Chronicle. Paborito rin ng marami ang aming al pastor, lengua, carnitas at shrimp burrito.</p></details><details><summary>May catering ba kayo?</summary><p>Oo, may catering kami. Tawagan ang truck para magtanong.</p></details><details><summary>May upuan at paradahan ba?</summary><p>May mga picnic table kami sa labas, at karamihan ng paradahan ay sa kalye.</p></details><details><summary>Kailan pinakamaraming tao?</summary><p>Tuwing Biyernes bandang 6 PM ang pinakamaraming tao, at maaaring umabot nang mga 15 minuto ang paghihintay.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">Bisitahin kami</p>\n      <h2>Oras at lokasyon</h2>\n      <address>809 Broadway<br>Vallejo, CA 94590</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\">(707) 334-8381</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>Lunes</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>Martes</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>Miyerkules</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>Huwebes</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>Biyernes</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>Sabado</td><td>Sarado</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>Linggo</td><td>Sarado</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">Sarado tuwing weekend. Cash o card (maaaring may maliit na bayad kapag card ang gamit). May catering kami, kaya tumawag para magtanong.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/640168939444142\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 8h3V4h-3a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2H8v4h2v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V8z\"/></svg><span>Facebook</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Yelp</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Pi%C3%B1ata+Taqueria/@38.1147339,-122.2487791,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085739c1a6761fb:0x55c92816b09cb66b!8m2!3d38.1147339!4d-122.2487791!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Google reviews</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 